@startuml component
title Cloud-One Client — Component Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor User

package "React 18 SPA" {
  [App.jsx\n(composition root)] as app
  [Header] as header
  [PrinterTable] as table
  [PrinterRow] as row
  [PrinterForm\n+ validatePrinter] as form
  [Drawer (modal-ish)] as drawer
  [usePrinters hook] as hook
  [PrintersApi interface] as iface
  [MockPrintersApi\n(fixture-backed)] as mock
  [HttpPrintersApi\n(real backend)] as http
  [PRINTERS_FIXTURE] as fixture
}

cloud "Printer backend\n(REST /printers)" as backend

User --> app
app --> header
app --> table
app --> form : create / edit modal
app --> drawer
table --> row
app --> hook : usePrinters()
hook --> iface : list / create / update / remove
iface <|.. mock
iface <|.. http
mock --> fixture
http --> backend : VITE_API_BASE

note bottom of iface
  Same shape from every impl:
  - list()   → {ok, items}
  - create() → {ok, item}
  - update() → {ok, item}
  - remove() → {ok} or {ok:false}
end note

note right of hook
  list + invalidate on every
  successful mutation. Replaces
  the original pubsub-js
  ON_REFRESH coupling.
end note
@enduml
